
---

# `.gitignore`

अब root में **`.gitignore`** नाम की file बनाओ और ये पूरा code paste करो:

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Environment files and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

backend/.env
frontend/.env

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Build files
dist/
build/
coverage/

# Vite
.vite/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE files
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# VS Code local settings
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Local database files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# MongoDB local data
data/db/
mongodb-data/

# Runtime files
*.pid
*.seed